er to the nearest percent.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."] [:db/add "6282714f-86f7-539d-8dcf-29f522eab8ab" :question/worked-solution "The initial population is $P_0=14$, the final population is $P=658$, and the elapsed time is $t=5$ minutes. The decimal rate $r$ is per minute.\n\nUse the continuously compounded growth equation, isolate the exponential, take natural logarithms, and solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nP &= P_0e^{rt} \\\\\n658 &= 14e^{5r} \\\\\ne^{5r} &= \\frac{658}{14} \\\\\n\\ln\\left(e^{5r}\\right) &= \\ln\\left(\\frac{658}{14}\\right) \\\\\n5r &= \\ln\\left(\\frac{658}{14}\\right) \\\\\nr &= \\frac{\\ln\\left(\\frac{658}{14}\\right)}{5} \\\\\nr &\\approx 0.7700295 \\\\\n100r &\\approx 77.00295\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConverting the decimal rate to a percentage and rounding to the nearest percent gives approximately $77\\%$ per minute."] [:db/add "6282714f-86f7-539d-8dcf-29f522eab8ab" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "6282714f-86f7-539d-8dcf-29f522eab8ab" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "6282714f-86f7-539d-8dcf-29f522eab8ab" :question/answer-fields "5886e3c9-2962-546e-b42b-4cd2bbbe535d"] [:db/ensure "6282714f-86f7-539d-8dcf-29f522eab8ab" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059797 :knowledge-point/questions "6282714f-86f7-539d-8dcf-29f522eab8ab"] [:db/add "1d67cb49-009a-566e-9248-70e5577b3dac" :answer/id #uuid "1d67cb49-009a-566e-9248-70e5577b3dac"] [:db/add "1d67cb49-009a-566e-9248-70e5577b3dac" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "1d67cb49-009a-566e-9248-70e5577b3dac" :answer/value "$126$ years"] [:db/ensure "1d67cb49-009a-566e-9248-70e5577b3dac" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fdd7f327-f838-5246-9d0d-249524b64271" :answer/id #uuid "fdd7f327-f838-5246-9d0d-249524b64271"] [:db/add "fdd7f327-f838-5246-9d0d-249524b64271" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "fdd7f327-f838-5246-9d0d-249524b64271" :answer/value "$130$ years"] [:db/ensure "fdd7f327-f838-5246-9d0d-249524b64271" 